speechtext:
Before I recognize the Minister of Fisheries (Mr. Robichaud) I would like to bring to the attention of hon. members the business for the adjournment debate this evening; the hon. member for Winnipeg North Centre (Mr. Knowles), Unemployment Insurance-possible increases in ceiling and benefit rates;

the hon. member for Lac-Saint-Jean (Mr. Simard), acceleration of construction of Saguenay-Lake St. John area;

the hon. member for Springfield (Mr. Schreyer), Department of Agriculture-bankruptcy of a livestock commission merchant at the St. Boniface stockyards.
